<Layout title="Consulting & Training" description="Emergency management consulting and instructor-led preparedness training with John Caverly in Washington State.">
  <ServicePaths />
  <section class="service-intro">
    <img class="consulting-logo" src="/je-caverly-logo-navy-green.png" alt="JE Caverly Consulting Services — Prepare, Respond, Recover, Mitigate" width="1254" height="1254" />
    <div><h2>Practical Planning. Effective Training. Stronger Preparedness.</h2><p>I help people and organizations think through emergencies, build useful plans, and prepare to respond. My independent consulting and training work serves businesses, public agencies, healthcare organizations, nonprofits, community groups, and individuals throughout Washington State.</p><p>My background includes healthcare emergency management, EMS, occupational health and safety, ICS and NIMS, emergency operations, Civil Air Patrol emergency services, public safety governance, and training and exercise development.</p><p class="service-disclaimer">These are independent services. They do not represent or imply endorsement by my employers, public agencies, volunteer organizations, Central Pierce Fire &amp; Rescue, FEMA, or the Civil Air Patrol.</p></div>
  </section>
</Layout>
